# TaskMaster UI Project
A simple Task master App UI built with HTML, CSS, and JavaScript using a modern folder structure (assets, components, templates).

## Project Structure
project-folder/
├── assets/
│   ├── css/
│   ├── js/
│   └── images/
├── components/
│     ├── dashboard
│     ├── community
│     ├── expenses
│     ├── task
│     ├── notes
│     ├── settings
│     └── login
│     └── signup
│     
├── index.html
└── login.html

## Features
Clean folder organization
Signup, Login, dashboard, community, expenses, tasks, notes, and settings pages

##  How to Use
Open signup.html or login.html or dashboard.html in your browser.
Use Live Server for faster preview.

##  Notes
All images are in assets/images.

